
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080808">
<title>صالون أحمد فريد | AF</title>

<style>
:root{
  --site-primary:#c9a24a;--site-background:#080808;
  --site-on-background:#f5f0e7;--muted:#aaa39a;
  --line:rgba(201,162,74,.22);--gold2:#f2d58d;
  --gold-glow:rgba(226,193,112,.32);--panel:#11110f;
  --site-heading-scale:1
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:85px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--site-background);color:var(--site-on-background);font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.7;overflow-x:hidden}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
#app{min-height:100vh;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.decor{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0,rgba(201,162,74,.15),transparent 48%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 55%,rgba(201,162,74,.07),transparent 30%)}
.content{position:relative;z-index:1}
.gold{color:var(--site-primary)}
.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:rgba(8,8,8,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);animation:navDrop .8s both}
.nav{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:12px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.brandmark{width:46px;height:46px;border:1px solid var(--site-primary);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--gold2);font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-2px;box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(201,162,74,.12);cursor:pointer;transition:.35s}
.brandmark:hover{transform:rotate(-8deg) scale(1.08);box-shadow:0 0 28px var(--gold-glow)}
.brandname{font-weight:800;line-height:1.3}
.brandname small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:400}
.navlinks{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px}
.navlinks a{color:#d5d0c7;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;transition:.25s}
.navlinks a:hover{color:var(--gold2)}
.btn{border:1px solid var(--site-primary);padding:11px 20px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--site-primary);color:#080808;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;text-align:center;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s,background .3s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--gold2);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(201,162,74,.2)}
.btn.outline{background:transparent;color:var(--gold2)}
.btn.dark{background:#191919;color:#eee;border-color:#444}
.btn.small{padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px}
button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}

/* HERO */
.hero{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;min-height:690px;padding:95px 24px 80px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:center;gap:50px}
.eyebrow{color:var(--gold2);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:700}
.hero>.eyebrow{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:5px}
.hero h1{font-family:Georgia,Tahoma,serif;font-size:calc(68px * var(--site-heading-scale));line-height:1.18;margin:18px 0;color:#f8f3e9;letter-spacing:-2px;animation:heroTextIn 1.1s .25s both}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--site-primary);display:block}
.hero p{max-width:510px;color:#b8b1a6;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 28px;animation:heroTextIn 1.1s .4s both}
.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;animation:heroTextIn 1.1s .55s both}
.hero-art{min-height:420px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;animation:heroArtIn 1.4s .25s both}
.hero-art:before,.hero-art:after{content:"";position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(226,193,112,.18);border-radius:50%;width:340px;height:340px;animation:orbit 12s linear infinite}
.hero-art:after{width:390px;height:390px;border-style:dashed;opacity:.35;animation-direction:reverse}
.portrait{width:270px;height:345px;border-radius:50% 50% 8px 8px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 38%,#5a4828,#171512 58%,#090909);border:1px solid #9b793b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(201,162,74,.035),0 0 55px rgba(201,162,74,.15),0 25px 80px #000;animation:portraitGlow 4s ease-in-out infinite;transition:transform .5s}
.portrait:hover{transform:translateY(-10px) scale(1.035)}
.portrait span{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:105px;color:#e8c66e;letter-spacing:-12px;text-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(232,198,110,.45);cursor:pointer}

/* SECTIONS */
.section{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:95px 24px}
.section-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:38px}
.section-head h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:calc(44px * var(--site-heading-scale));margin:8px 0;color:#f4eee2}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.service{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(34,31,25,.92),rgba(11,11,10,.97));border:1px solid rgba(201,162,74,.28);padding:25px;min-height:230px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.4s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px}
.service:hover{transform:translateY(-9px);border-color:var(--gold2);box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.4),0 0 22px var(--gold-glow)}
.service:before,.gallery-tile:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:2;background:linear-gradient(115deg,transparent 25%,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 48%,transparent 70%);transform:translateX(-120%);transition:transform .8s}
.service:hover:before,.gallery-tile:hover:before{transform:translateX(120%)}
.service-icon{width:48px;height:48px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--gold2);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(201,162,74,.045)}
.service h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}
.service p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;flex:1}
.service-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:18px;color:var(--gold2);font-size:13px}
.price{font-weight:800}
.service-foot del{color:#999;margin-left:5px}

/* VIP */
.vip{background:linear-gradient(110deg,rgba(201,162,74,.13),rgba(18,18,17,.95) 48%),#111;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.vip-inner{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:60px 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:25px}
.vip h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:calc(36px * var(--site-heading-scale));margin:8px 0}
.vip p{color:#c0b8aa;max-width:650px;margin:0}

/* GALLERY */
.gallery-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
.gallery-tile{min-height:205px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#383027,#141311 55%,#806333);border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:rgba(242,213,141,.7);position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:3px;transition:.4s}
.gallery-tile:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);border-color:var(--gold2);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.gallery-tile img{width:100%;height:205px;object-fit:cover}
.gallery-description{color:#c5bba8;font:12px Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;padding:8px 12px}
.gallery-prices{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px;font-size:14px;background:#10100e}
.gallery-prices del{color:#999}
.gallery-prices strong{color:var(--gold2)}

/* BOOKING */
.booking-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:35px;align-items:start}
.booking-info,.form-card{padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(25,23,19,.98),rgba(11,11,10,.98))}
.booking-info h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:27px;margin:0 0 10px}
.booking-info p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.info-line{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #28251e;color:#d8d0c1;font-size:13px}
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.field.full{grid-column:1/-1}
.field label{font-size:12px;color:#d8c99f}
.field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;background:#090909;border:1px solid #39352b;color:#f6f0e5;padding:12px;border-radius:2px;outline:none}
.field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--site-primary);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(201,162,74,.08)}

/* قائمة الخدمات والأسعار */
.service-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:5px}
.service-option{
 display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px;
 background:#090909;border:1px solid #39352b;
 cursor:pointer;transition:.25s;border-radius:3px;min-width:0
}
.service-option:has(input:checked){
 border-color:var(--site-primary);
 background:rgba(201,162,74,.09)
}
.service-option input{
 width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--site-primary);
 cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0
}
.service-option-info{
 flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px
}
.service-option-name{font-size:13px;color:#f5f0e7}
.service-price-box{
 display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px
}
.service-old-price{color:#999;text-decoration:line-through}
.service-new-price{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:800}
.service-saving{color:#8fd7a0;font-size:11px}
.service-normal-price{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:800}
.selected-total{
 margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:#1b1a15;
 border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--gold2);
 font-weight:bold;font-size:13px
}
.selected-breakdown{
 display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:9px;padding-top:9px;
 border-top:1px solid var(--line)
}
.selected-breakdown-row{
 display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;
 font-size:12px;color:#e7dfcf
}
.selected-breakdown-row small{color:#aaa}
.selected-saving-total{color:#8fd7a0;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}
.selected-unknown{color:#e6c77e;font-size:11px;margin-top:8px}
.hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.form-actions{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.notice{padding:12px 14px;background:#1b1a15;border:1px solid var(--line);color:#e5d4a7;font-size:12px;margin-top:15px;display:none;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 24px;color:#8e887d;text-align:center;font-size:12px}
footer strong{color:var(--gold2);cursor:pointer}

/* INTRO */
#intro{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(116,83,30,.25),transparent 55%),#080808;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;transition:opacity .8s,visibility .8s}
#intro:before,#intro:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:min(78vw,650px);height:min(78vw,650px);border:1px solid rgba(226,193,112,.12);border-radius:50%;animation:halo 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
#intro:after{width:min(90vw,750px);height:min(90vw,750px);border-color:rgba(226,193,112,.045);animation-direction:alternate-reverse}
.intro-box{text-align:center;position:relative;z-index:1;animation:introIn 1s both}
.intro-logo{width:min(68vw,500px);height:auto;overflow:visible;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 18px rgba(226,193,112,.25));animation:logoFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite}
.intro-logo .letters{fill:#f0cf79;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:250px;font-weight:700;opacity:0;text-anchor:middle;stroke:#8f6b2c;stroke-width:1.2px;letter-spacing:-12px}
.intro-logo .letter-a{font-style:italic;transform-origin:255px 330px;animation:letterAIn 1s .2s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) forwards}
.intro-logo .letter-f{font-weight:400;transform-origin:355px 390px;animation:letterFIn 1s .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) forwards}
.intro-line{height:1px;width:0;margin:14px auto 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#e7c36f,transparent);animation:lineIn .8s 1.35s forwards}
.intro-caption{color:#b9a477;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:5px;margin-top:15px;opacity:0;animation:captionIn .8s 1.5s forwards}
#intro.hide{opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none}
@keyframes letterAIn{0%{opacity:0;transform:translate(-650px,-75px) rotate(-18deg)}75%{opacity:1;transform:translate(12px,5px) rotate(3deg)}100%{opacity:1;transform:translate(0,0) rotate(0)}}
@keyframes letterFIn{0%{opacity:0;transform:translate(650px,-75px) rotate(18deg)}75%{opacity:1;transform:translate(-12px,5px) rotate(-3deg)}100%{opacity:1;transform:translate(0,0) rotate(0)}}
@keyframes logoFloat{50%{transform:translateY(-7px);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 28px rgba(226,193,112,.48))}}
@keyframes halo{to{transform:scale(1.1);opacity:.3}}
@keyframes lineIn{to{width:190px}}
@keyframes captionIn{to{opacity:1;letter-spacing:7px}}
@keyframes introIn{from{transform:scale(.78);opacity:0;filter:blur(10px)}to{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;filter:blur(0)}}
@keyframes navDrop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-25px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes heroTextIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(35px);filter:blur(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);filter:blur(0)}}
@keyframes heroArtIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-45px) scale(.88);filter:blur(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0) scale(1);filter:blur(0)}}
@keyframes portraitGlow{0%,100%{filter:brightness(1)}50%{filter:brightness(1.13)}}
@keyframes orbit{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}

/* REVEAL */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(45px) scale(.97);filter:blur(7px);transition:opacity .9s,transform .9s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),filter .9s}
.reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);filter:blur(0)}

/* ADMIN */
#adminView{display:none;min-height:100vh;background:#0a0a0a;padding:30px 18px;position:relative;z-index:2}
#adminView.active{display:block}
#publicView.hidden{display:none}
.admin-shell{max-width:1100px;margin:auto}
.admin-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:18px;margin-bottom:25px}
.admin-top h1{font-size:25px;margin:0}
.admin-login{max-width:410px;margin:8vh auto;padding:32px;background:#121210;border:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center;box-shadow:0 20px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.admin-login .brandmark{margin:0 auto 15px}
.admin-login input{width:100%;margin:8px 0;background:#080808;color:white;border:1px solid #49402d;padding:13px}
.admin-note{color:#958d7e;font-size:11px}
.admin-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
.tab{background:#171715;color:#d5c9a9;border:1px solid #403a2d;padding:9px 14px}
.tab.active{background:var(--site-primary);color:#080808}
.admin-panel{display:none;background:#111;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px}
.admin-panel.active{display:block}
.admin-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
.admin-table th,.admin-table td{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #302c23;text-align:right}
.admin-table th{color:var(--gold2)}
.admin-table td{color:#ddd}
.admin-table input{width:100%;min-width:75px;background:#080808;color:#fff;border:1px solid #454033;padding:8px}
.admin-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px}
.admin-form input{min-width:0;background:#080808;color:#fff;border:1px solid #454033;padding:10px}
.admin-form button{min-width:120px}
.empty{color:#999;text-align:center;padding:30px}
.admin-card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
.admin-card{border:1px solid #393326;padding:14px;background:#0c0c0b;transition:.3s;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.admin-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:var(--gold2)}
.admin-card button{margin-top:10px}
.admin-error{color:#ff9d9d;background:rgba(130,20,20,.13);border:1px solid rgba(255,100,100,.25);padding:10px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}

@media(max-width:800px){
  .navlinks{display:none}
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;padding-top:65px;gap:25px}
  .hero p{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
  .actions{justify-content:center}
  .hero-art{min-height:360px}
  .portrait{height:285px;width:220px}
  .service-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .booking-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .vip-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center}
  .vip p{margin:auto}
  .gallery-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media(max-width:520px){
  .hero h1{font-size:45px}
  .section{padding:55px 17px}
  .service-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .field.full{grid-column:auto}
  .form-card{padding:18px}
  .gallery-tile{min-height:150px}
  .admin-form{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .admin-table{font-size:11px;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
  .admin-table th,.admin-table td{padding:8px}
  .admin-card-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .brandname{font-size:13px}
  #adminView{padding:20px 10px}
  .admin-panel{padding:12px}
  .admin-login{padding:22px}
  .service-options{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*:before,*:after{scroll-behavior:auto!important;animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}
  .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;filter:none}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div id="intro" aria-label="AF intro">
  <div class="intro-box">
    <svg class="intro-logo" viewBox="0 0 620 570" role="img" aria-label="AF">
      <text class="letters letter-a" x="255" y="330">A</text>
      <text class="letters letter-f" x="355" y="390">F</text>
    </svg>
    <div class="intro-line"></div>
    <div class="intro-caption">AHMED FAREED SALON</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="app">
<div class="decor"></div>

<div id="publicView" class="content">
<header class="topbar">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#home">
      <div class="brandmark" title="AF">AF</div>
      <div class="brandname">صالون أحمد فريد<small>AHMED FAREED SALON</small></div>
    </a>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <a href="#services">الخدمات</a>
      <a href="#vip">باقة العرسان</a>
      <a href="#gallery">معرض الأعمال</a>
      <a href="#booking">الحجز</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn small" href="#booking">احجز موعدك</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">THE ART OF GROOMING</div>
    <h1>أناقتك تبدأ من <span>التفاصيل.</span></h1>
    <p>تجربة عناية متكاملة تجمع بين الاحترافية والاهتمام بأدق التفاصيل. اختار خدمتك وسيب الباقي علينا.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn" href="#booking">احجز موعدك الآن</a>
      <a class="btn outline" href="#services">اكتشف الخدمات</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-art"><div class="portrait"><span>AF</span></div></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">THE ART OF EXCELLENCE</div>
    <h2>خدماتنا</h2>
    <p>اهتمام متكامل بإطلالتك من أول لمسة لآخر تفصيلة.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-grid" id="serviceGrid"></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="offers">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">SPECIAL OFFERS</div>
    <h2>العروض الخاصة</h2>
    <p>اختار العرض المناسب واستمتع بتجربة AF.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="service-grid" id="offerGrid"><div class="empty">تابع عروضنا الجديدة قريباً.</div></div>
</section>

<section class="vip" id="vip">
  <div class="vip-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">EXCLUSIVE EXPERIENCE</div>
      <h2>باقة العرسان <span class="gold">VIP ROOM</span></h2>
      <p>تجربة خاصة للعرسان داخل غرفة VIP، تجمع خدمات العناية والتجهيز في أجواء راقية وخصوصية كاملة.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="#booking" onclick="chooseService('باقة العرسان VIP Room')">احجز باقة العرسان</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="gallery">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">OUR WORK</div>
    <h2>لمسات من شغلنا</h2>
    <p>معرض أعمال الصالون — يتم تحديثه باستمرار.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="gallery-grid" id="galleryGrid"></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="booking">
  <div class="section-head">
